M10_Gate_Check save/load robustness. first/second are set in Action_Complete()
and route objective events 1005/1006/1007 to controller 1100154 in Poked(), but
were not saved. Register them with the unused ids 2 and 3. Saves without these
ids still load (unknown/missing ids are ignored by the original loader).

--- a/Mission10.cpp
+++ b/Mission10.cpp
@@ -2649,6 +2649,9 @@
 	REGISTER_VARIABLES()
 	{
 		SAVE_VARIABLE( already_poked, 1 );
+		// Vita save/load: first/second route objectives 1005/1006/1007 in Poked().
+		SAVE_VARIABLE( first, 2 );
+		SAVE_VARIABLE( second, 3 );
 	}
 
 	void Created (GameObject *obj)
